  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.description": "Arcane Armory's materials and their traits, where to find them, and the gear they make.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.bows.about.text": "Every material makes a bow. Arrows from a stronger material's bow hit harder.\\\n\\\nA bow lasts four fifths as long as its material's tools and draws like a vanilla bow.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.bows.about.title": "Bows",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.bows.description": "A bow for every material",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.bows.name": "Bows",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.description": "Hammers, bows, shields, and the smithing table",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.doomflare.about.text": "Harmless until an explosion destroys it. Then it explodes with the force of ten TNT, setting off any Doomflare Blocks nearby.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.doomflare.about.title": "Doomflare Block",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.doomflare.description": "Handle with care",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.doomflare.name": "Doomflare Block",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.hammers.about.text": "A hammer mines a 3x3 square facing the side you hit. It breaks only blocks it could mine on its own, and they drop as if the hammer mined each one, so Fortune and Silk Touch apply.\\\n\\\nSneak to break a single block.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.hammers.about.title": "Hammers",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.hammers.description": "Mine a 3x3 square at once",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.hammers.name": "Hammers",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.name": "Equipment",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.shields.about.text": "Ruby, Coolpper, Titanium, Arcanthium, and Voidium make shields. They block like a vanilla shield, wear down as they block, and an axe hit disables them for a moment.\\\n\\\nA shield lasts nine tenths as long as its material's tools.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.shields.about.title": "Shields",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.shields.description": "Five materials make shields",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.shields.name": "Shields",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.voidium_upgrade.about.text": "Voidium gear is not crafted. At a smithing table, combine a Black Diamond tool, weapon, or armor piece with a [](item://arcanearmory:voidium_ingot). Enchantments carry over.\\\n\\\nBlack Diamond has no shield, so the Voidium Shield is still crafted.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.voidium_upgrade.about.title": "Voidium Upgrade",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.voidium_upgrade.description": "Upgrade Black Diamond gear to Voidium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.equipment.voidium_upgrade.name": "Voidium Upgrade",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aetheric_crystal.about.text": "Common ore between Y 0 and 64.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Jump Boost.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aetheric_crystal.about.title": "Aetheric Crystal",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aetheric_crystal.description": "Full set: Jump Boost.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aetheric_crystal.name": "Aetheric Crystal",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.amber.about.text": "Ore lining the inside of amber geodes, deep underground.\\\n\\\n**On hit:** slows the target for 2 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.amber.about.title": "Amber",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.amber.description": "On hit: slows the target for 2 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.amber.name": "Amber",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aquamarine.about.text": "Ore beneath oceans and beaches, and in lush caves.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Water Breathing.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aquamarine.about.title": "Aquamarine",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aquamarine.description": "Full set: Water Breathing.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.aquamarine.name": "Aquamarine",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.arcanthium.about.text": "An alloy: Titanium Ingot, Aetheric Crystal, Arcanthe or a Wither Rose, and Pink Dye make two ingots.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Speed.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.arcanthium.about.title": "Arcanthium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.arcanthium.description": "Full set: Speed.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.arcanthium.name": "Arcanthium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.black_diamond.about.text": "Rare ore at the bottom of the world, below Y -32.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Resistance.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.black_diamond.about.title": "Black Diamond",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.black_diamond.description": "Full set: Resistance.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.black_diamond.name": "Black Diamond",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.bloodfire_garnet.about.text": "Ore throughout the Nether.\\\n\\\n**On hit:** heals you half a heart.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.bloodfire_garnet.about.title": "Bloodfire Garnet",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.bloodfire_garnet.description": "On hit: heals you half a heart.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.bloodfire_garnet.name": "Bloodfire Garnet",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.chrysoberyl.about.text": "Ore underground, between Y -12 and 12.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Night Vision.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.chrysoberyl.about.title": "Chrysoberyl",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.chrysoberyl.description": "Full set: Night Vision.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.chrysoberyl.name": "Chrysoberyl",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.coolpper.about.text": "Common ore between Y 0 and 64. Craft the ore straight into two ingots.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Fire Resistance.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.coolpper.about.title": "Coolpper",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.coolpper.description": "Full set: Fire Resistance.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.coolpper.name": "Coolpper",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.description": "Each material, its trait, and where it comes from",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.name": "Materials",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.description": "What every material makes",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.intro.text": "Arcane Armory adds 14 materials for gear. Each makes a sword, pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe, hammer, bow, and four armor pieces, and some also make a shield. Most are crafted like their vanilla counterparts; Voidium is upgraded from Black Diamond.\\\n\\\nEvery material has one trait, shown in each item's tooltip.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.intro.title": "Arcane Materials",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.name": "Arcane Materials",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.traits.text": "**On hit** traits work when you strike something with that material's weapon or tool in your main hand.\\\n\\\n**Full set** bonuses need all four armor pieces of the same material.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.overview.traits.title": "Traits",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.ruby.about.text": "Ore deep underground, below Y 12.\\\n\\\n**On hit:** sets the target on fire for 3 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.ruby.about.title": "Ruby",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.ruby.description": "On hit: sets the target on fire for 3 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.ruby.name": "Ruby",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.sapphire.about.text": "Ore deep underground, below Y 12.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Haste.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.sapphire.about.title": "Sapphire",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.sapphire.description": "Full set: Haste.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.sapphire.name": "Sapphire",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.star_corundum.about.text": "Ore found only inside meteors.\\\n\\\n**On hit:** makes the target glow for 5 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.star_corundum.about.title": "Star Corundum",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.star_corundum.description": "On hit: makes the target glow for 5 seconds.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.star_corundum.name": "Star Corundum",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.titanium.about.text": "Ore below Y 42.\\\n\\\n**Armor:** each piece adds knockback resistance, like netherite.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.titanium.about.title": "Titanium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.titanium.description": "Armor: each piece adds knockback resistance, like netherite.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.titanium.name": "Titanium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.topaz.about.text": "Ore deep underground, below Y 12.\\\n\\\n**Full set:** Luck.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.topaz.about.title": "Topaz",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.topaz.description": "Full set: Luck.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.topaz.name": "Topaz",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.voidium.about.text": "An alloy: Void Obsidian Fragment, Bloodfire Garnet, and a Netherite Ingot make two ingots.\\\n\\\n**On hit:** makes the target float up for a second.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.voidium.about.title": "Voidium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.voidium.description": "On hit: makes the target float up for a second.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.materials.voidium.name": "Voidium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.name": "Arcane Compendium",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.tooltip": "A guide to Arcane Armory",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.arcanthe.about.text": "A pink flower with a glowing teal tip. It never grows in the world, but it can be planted and potted.\\\n\\\nIt goes into Arcanthium, where a Wither Rose works in its place.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.arcanthe.about.title": "Arcanthe",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.arcanthe.description": "A flower that never grows wild",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.arcanthe.name": "Arcanthe",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.description": "Where the rarer finds come from",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.about.text": "- [](item://arcanearmory:frost_diamond): snowy and frozen biomes, below Y 16.\n- [](item://arcanearmory:solarflare_gem): deserts and badlands, below Y -32.\n- [](item://arcanearmory:shadow_crystal): the Nether, between Y 32 and 64.\n- [](item://arcanearmory:doom_fragment): the Nether, rarely.\n- [](item://arcanearmory:void_obsidian_fragment): End stone in the End.\n",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.about.title": "Gems and Fragments",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.description": "Finds that make no gear of their own",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.name": "Gems and Fragments",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.uses.text": "Frost Diamond crafts into 16 Ice. A Solarflare Gem is a furnace fuel that smelts 12 items.\\\n\\\nThe rest go into Doomflare Blocks and Voidium.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.gems_and_fragments.uses.title": "Uses",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.craters.text": "Rarely, the Overworld surface holds a small crater with a boulder of [](item://arcanearmory:meteorite) around a core of [](item://arcanearmory:star_corundum_ore). Meteors are the only source of Star Corundum.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.craters.title": "Meteors",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.description": "The only source of Star Corundum",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.falling.text": "On Minecraft 1.21.11 and newer, some nights a meteor streaks across the sky and lands as a fresh boulder, at least 48 blocks from any player.",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.falling.title": "Falling Meteors",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.meteors.name": "Meteors",
  "book.arcanearmory.arcane_compendium.world.name": "World",
  "commands.arcanearmory.meteor.falling": "A meteor is falling toward %s, %s, %s",
  "commands.arcanearmory.meteor.no_ground": "No open ground for a meteor nearby",
  "commands.arcanearmory.meteor.overworld_only": "Meteors only fall in the Overworld",
